    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Independent digital type foundry founded 2010, co-founded by Timo Gaessner (Berlin, via his studio 123buero) and Alexander Colby (Zurich); Walker Art Center and other press describe it as Zurich-based, hence Berlin/Zurich framing. Known for Maison, Maison Neue, Patron, Chapeau, Boutique. Monotype acquired five of its typeface families in March 2023; milieugrotesque.com now redirects entirely to MyFonts and the Instagram bio points to the Monotype-owned @ByMonotype, so it is unclear whether the foundry still operates independently for custom work or is now effectively wound down as a distribution channel. Work Status left Unknown pending clarification. No LinkedIn company page or public contact email found (two searches each, time boxed).",
